+	 * Quinary MI2S carries the microphone path: the codec's ASP1 lands here,
+	 * not on the Secondary TDM bus the speakers use. Samsung's own node calls
+	 * these quin_mi2s but the pinmux function is spkr_i2s. Capture arrives on
+	 * SD1 (tx-lines = 0x2 downstream); SD0 is the unused playback direction.
