+/*
+ * Audio front ends (what userspace opens) and the one back end this board
+ * actually has: Secondary TDM out to the four CS35L41 amps. The TDM timing
+ * values are copied from Samsung's overlay node qcom,msm-dai-tdm-sec-rx, which
+ * overrides the generic sm8150 reference values in the base DTB. Use the
+ * overlay's, not the base DTB's: they differ in sync-mode and invert-sync.
